<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ninevi khaw phurrit chu. Elkos mi Nahuma inlârna hmuh bu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu thîkthuchhia Pathian leh phuba lâk hmang a ni; Lalpa chuan phuba a la a, thinurnain a khat a ni; Lalpa chuan amah dotute chungah phuba a la a, a hmêlmate tân chuan thinurna a khâwl khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu a thin a nel a, nasa taka thiltithei a ni a, mi sual chu thiam a chantîr rêng rêng lo vang. Lalpa chuan ṭhâwngaleivirah leh thlipuiah a kawng a nei a, chhûmte chu a kea vaivut a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuifinriat chu a zilhhau va, a tikang chat a, lui zawng zawngte pawh a tikang zo va. Basan ram leh Karmel tlâng a ro zo va, Lebanon tlâng pangpâr chu a chuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlâng liante chu amah avângin an nghîng a, tlâng tête chu an tui ral a; a hmaah chuan lei hi a khûr a, a ni, khawvêl leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungnih lohna hmaah chuan tu nge ding thei anga, a thinrimna nasa takah chuan tu nge awm thei ang? A thinrimna chu mei anga leih buak a ni a, lungpuite chu a tikeh sawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ṭha a, mangan nia kulh nghet a ni; amaha an rinna nghattute chu a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah dotute erawh chu tui lian nasa tak hmangin a tiboral vek ang a, a hmêlmate chu khawthimah a ûm lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa kalhin eng nge in suangtuah? Tâwp dêrna a thlentîr dâwn a ni, phuba lâk nawn a ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An uain in chuan chiah huh hnêp mah sela, hlîng bawn ang leh buhpâwl ro ang maia tihboral vek an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmaha chhuak mi pakhat, Lalpa kalha thil sual ngaihtuahtu, suahsualna thu râwntu a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “An chak theihtâwpin chak mah sela, tam pawh tam tak ni mah sela, chuti chung pawhin sâm thlûkin an awm ang a, an boral ang. Lo tihrehawm tawh che mah ila, ka tihrehawm leh tawh lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah chuan i hnên ata a nghâwngkawl chu ka titliak ang, nangmah phuarna hruite chu ka tichat vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan i chungchâng thûah thu a pe a: “I hming pu tûr thlah i nei lo vang. I pathianho in ata milem siam chawp leh milem chhûnte chu ka tiboral ang a; i thlân ka siam ang, i sual si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlângahte Chanchin Ṭha thlena, remna thu tlângaupuitu ke chu en teh! Aw Juda, i kûtte chu serh la, i thutiamte chu hlen rawh. Mi suaksual chuan a palzût leh dâwn tawh si lo che a; tihboral dêr a ni ta e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tikeh sawmtu chu i hmai hmaah a lo chhuak e. Kulhbîng chu enkawl la, kawng chu vêng rawh; i kâwng tikhauh la, i thiltihtheihna chu chak takin siam ṭha rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-ho ropuina angin Jakob-ho ropuina chu Lalpa chuan a tungding leh si a; tiruaktute chuan anmahni an tiruak zo tawh a, an grêp pêngte an tichhe tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mi chakte phaw chu thisen a ni a, mi huaisente chu a sen lârin an inthuam a. A inbuatsaihna nîah chuan tawlailîrte chu kahpathîr tlein a tle zawr zawr a, feite chu râpthlâk takin a phe zawk zawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawlailîrte chu kawtthlêrah an tlân bur bur a, lamlian zauvahte chuan an insu sawk sawk a; meichher angin an lang a, kâwlphe angin an tlân thuak thuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mi liante chu a ko chhuak a, an kal rual chu an petek a; kulh bang lam pan chuan an hmanhmawh a, thil phen tûr an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui kawngkhârte chu hawn a ni a, lal in chu tihralin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Huzzabi chu an hlîp a, an kal bopui a, a bâwihnute chuan an âwm chûmin ṭhuro hrâm ang maiin an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmasâng ata Ninevi chu dîl ang a ni a, a sah ta hum hum a. “Ding rawh u, ding rawh u,” tiin an au va; mahse, tu mah an hawi kîr lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangkaraw sumte chu lâksak ula, rangkachak sumte chu lâksak rawh u! Thil chhêk khâwm leh bungraw ṭha zawng zawng ropuizia chuan tâwpintai a nei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tihruahin a awm a, a ruak dêr a, a ram a ni! Thinlung chu a tituiral a, khûpte chu a inkhâwng a, kâwng zawng zawng a na ngawih ngawih a, an zavaia hmêl a dâng zo vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu ma tihṭit loh va an awmna, sakeibakneipa te, sakeibakneipui te, sakeibakneino te an kal vêlna, sakeibaknei bu zâwl leh sakeibakneinoten an eina hmun chu khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sakeibakneipa chuan a note kham khawp a pawt sawm a, sakeibakneipuite tân a seh hlum a, a pûkte chu sa sehin a tikhat a, a bu zâwlte chu sa ruang pawh sawmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, “Ngai teh, ka do che a ni; i tawlailîrte chu ka hâl khu hluah hluah ang a, i sakeibakneinote chu khandaihin a tiboral ang; tin, leia i sa seh hi ka tikin ang a, i palaite aw chu hriat a ni tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thisen chhuah hmang khawpui chu a chung a pik e! Dâwt leh inrawknain a khat vek a; an sa seh chu a chatlak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vuakna vai rîk te, tawlailîr ke innghawr ri te, sakawr zuang te, tawlailîr tlân hlawk hlawk te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sakawr chung chuang mi sakawra chuang te, khandaih tle zawk zawk te, fei tle zawr zawr te nên; mi thah awm rem rum te, ruang awm rei rui te nên; ruangin kin tih rêng a nei lo, an ruangte chu an chhuih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chûng chu nawhchizuar hmêl ṭha, dawithiamnu, a uirena avânga hnam hralha, a dawi chînna avânga chhûngkaw hralhtu uirena nasa tak avânga lo awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, ka do che a ni; i hmai lamah i puan ka hlîm ang a; i saruakna chu hnamte hnênah leh i mualphona chu lalramte hnênah ka entîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawlhhlawh tenawm takin ka theh ang che a, zahthlâk takin ka siam ang che a, ennawm atân ka dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a hmu apiang che chu i lakah an tlân bo vang a, ‘Ninevi khua chu a lo ram ta a ni! Tuin nge sûn ang?’ Khawi ata nge i tân thlamuantute ka zawn tâk ang?” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile lui luan hual No-amon, a kulh atân tuipui hmanga, a in hung nâna dîl hmang aiin i chak zâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia leh Aigupta chu a chakna a ni a, chu chu tâwp chin nei lo a ni; Put leh Lubim chu nangmah ṭanpuitute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti chung pawh chuan lâk bovin a awm a, salah a tâng a; kawtthlêr tin tâwpah a naupang tête chu an paih sawmsak a; a mi ṭhate tân ṭhum an vâwr a, a mi lian zawng zawngte chu khaidiatin phuar an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang pawh i rui bawk ang a, thuhrûkin i awm ang; hmêlma avângin kulh nghet i zawng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I kulh zawng zawngte chu theipui kûng, rah hmin hmasa pu ang an ni ang a; an nghîn phawt chuan eitu kaah an tla lût ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chhûnga i mipuite chu hmeichhia an ni a! I hmêlmate tân i ram kawngka chu a inhawng huai a; i in kalhna thîr tlâwnte chu meiin a kâng ral a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hual vêla i awm chhûng atân tui chawi la, i kulhte tinghet rawh; hlum awmnaah chuan kal la, lung chârna chu chîl la, lei rawh channa thuk chu tinghet rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutah chuan meiin a kâng ral ang che a, khandaihin a sât hlum ang che a, thingngêt angin a tiboral ang che. Thingngêt angin intitam la, khaukhuap angin intitam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I sumdâwngtute chu vân arsi aia tamin i tipung a: thingngêtin a thla a zâra, a thlâwk bo ang hian an bo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I mi, lallukhum khumte chu khaukhuap ang an ni a, i sipai hotute chu khaw vawh nia pala khau rual fu khâwm ang an ni; amaherawhchu, ni a lo chhuak a, an thlâwk bo va, an awmna hmun rêng hriat a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Assuria lal, i berâm vêngtute chu an muthlu e; i mi liante chu an châwl a. I mipuite chu tlângahte an darh zo va, hruai khâwmtu tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I na damna tûr a awm lo va, i hliam chu a nasa hle a ni. I thâwm hria apiangin kut an ben khum che; i suahsualnain a chîm fo loh tu nge awm?
  </para>
</usx>
